---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Activewear Trends 2026: What US and European Retailers are Sourcing Now"
  description="Stay ahead of the market with Fitclo's analysis of trending styles, colors, and fabric technologies for the 2026 fitness apparel market."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Market Intelligence</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Activewear Trends 2026: The <span class="text-accent italic">B2B Buyer's Guide</span></h2>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 19, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>9 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">Data-driven sourcing is the difference between a sold-out collection and a warehouse full of dead stock. Here is what our $30k+ partners are ordering right now.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. The Rise of "Naked-Feel" Compression</h2>
      <p>In the US market, consumers are moving away from thick, heavy fabrics. The current demand is for ultra-fine Nylon/Spandex blends that provide high compression with a "barely-there" sensation. Our proprietary <strong>FitSoft™ fabric</strong> is currently our #1 bulk-ordered material for this reason.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Earth-Toned Aesthetics</h2>
      <p>Vibrant neons are taking a backseat to sophisticated, muted palettes. Large-scale retailers in Europe are focusing on Sage Green, Burnt Sienna, and Slate Blue. These "lifestyle-neutral" colors increase the versatility of the garment, appealing to the "athleisure" crossover market.</p>

      <div class="my-12 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="aspect-square bg-[#7B8B6F] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs">SAGE</div>
        <div class="aspect-square bg-[#A45C40] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs">SIENNA</div>
        <div class="aspect-square bg-[#5D6D7E] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs">SLATE</div>
        <div class="aspect-square bg-[#34495E] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs">NAVY</div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Functional Modularity</h2>
      <p>Buyers are looking for features that add tangible value: integrated phone pockets in leggings, removable internal pads in bras, and thumbhole loops in jackets. For large-scale procurement, these small details justify a 15-20% higher retail price point, significantly boosting merchant profit.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Stay Ahead of the Curve</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Subscribe to our monthly trend report and get first access to new stock drops.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Get Trend Report</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
